  "solution": "**BODMAS Table:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/7751840ca1840d12cadc428f84d30e2cdcd5e7f82d52a57de21f2404c58eed88.png] \n\n**Given Equation: **​​sqrt[4]{256} * 9 * 26 * 33 *(18 * 2) *(63 * 9)\n\nLet's check each option One by One:\n\nOption 1) ÷, +, =, −, ×, +, ÷\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get:\n\n​​sqrt[4]{256} ÷ 9 + 26 = 33 - (18 × 2) + (63 ÷ 9)​\n\n​​sqrt[4]{256} ÷ 9 + 26 = 33 - 36 + 7\n\n4 ÷ 9 + 26 = 33 - 36 + 7\n\n0.4 + 26 = 40 - 36\n\n26.4 ≠ 4\n\nOption 2) ×, +, −, +, ×, =, ÷\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get:\n\nsqrt[4]{256} × 9 + 26 - 33 + (18 × 2) = (63 ÷ 9)\n\nsqrt[4]{256} × 9 + 26 - 33 + 36 = 7\n\n4 × 9 + 26 - 33 + 36 = 7\n\n36 + 26 - 33 + 36 = 7\n\n98 - 33 = 7\n\n65 ≠ 7.\n\nOption 3) +, −, +, ÷, =, ×, +\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get:\n\nsqrt[4]{256} + 9 - 26 + 33 ÷ (18 = 2) × (63 + 9)\n\nsqrt[4]{256} + 9 - 26 + 33 ÷ 18 = 2 × 72\n\n4 + 9 - 26 + 1.83 = 2 × 72\n\n4 + 9 - 26 + 1.83 = 154\n\n14.83 - 26 = 154\n\n-11.17 ≠ 154.\n\n**Option 4) ×, +, =, +, ×, −, ÷ **\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get:\n\nsqrt[4]{256} × 9 + 26 = 33 + (18 × 2) - (63 ÷ 9)\n\nsqrt[4]{256} × 9 + 26 = 33 + 36 - 7\n\n4 × 9 + 26 = 33 + 36 - 7\n\n36 + 26 = 33 + 36 - 7\n\n62 = 69 - 7\n\n**62 = 62.**\n\nHence, the correct answer is ***'Option 4'.***\n\n74:T1215,\n\nB",
